 style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;有超过 800,000 名客户&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/tZd_ylVl2GMB6F07omnOMsEZ5_zgw7i0IQplujdH-n4sekbRsPS86ehPk5Cfal_UXlt_Q0oWi22jz25zWNBUhgL4dus0KdavQjgDY8vWSao-7o-_IzXNouBaR0j8bF3ml4XiVm7SCBNn7cxqutguO3fehTKaQXRP3kLZfE28EftFA3yRCdMSTsg1Oi7loMdS-ZevfCAkY5QRIBDi1jJdvBAmeSLyfOfDy_UJJemzJPQAhTWXxfFwPvRbFM0G29DZuWuhPoF0yYpa6TBo8E29NyTivpElsPPftfi_BRUnz0UKnsEelE0sTMLvtfzZAK34pTyJ7hF2qMW0-58hAmNBJSLyz99LnozS6nhnRpvddeJIQYr6taqn-Ogq_DiEskHkay1KwMryIDuTXmwa8S7YCbvD3T9e89LNMzTsGfqTa9ybEGvPMBKRQDW5EgJo-Qj-3lNBXGTyn-JlXzlYEKNa9Sar5G8yot2ieGmfJFADbmwCeJWF1pt_S5ktKLF-fH0jSI3ua1q_UVrS8r-QHYu1Cwa-1EfOxO5xG7NxvAkXAte7rneXKKHY75DB/k_u0lbPcj7q-WqSSXJNU9b3FuLPUsmu7/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="伊萨亚斯袭击墨西哥湾沿岸后导致数千人断电"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;断电&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;这是大西洋风暴季节的第一场飓风，由于厄尔尼诺现象，飓风季节异常安静。尽管如此，气候变化仍可能导致更具破坏性的个别风暴。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;最后，我们来看看今年印度尼西亚森林火灾席卷东南亚的有毒雾霾为何如此严重，以及各国政府如何努力&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/rmYko7UONyRMu9kSj5Cg5Y6Zyyyak_mPsAzobRYtUFgFnLEPN3B16UuoFp3h7IYh4faABNg1SfSXM6GOFemxL06Cw7G3-gA1TTzPAb1s3avPnQs3m3PEA0EsTfdSOH4mvFmBVOdBj_9rOe4AIJjNv-7xWfGTBYBOaCpaFYPBxvjEnWSnG2zyEik7GLEVJu4d8NDGPNVsyY0ib6BuPOcW7jdsGJrvnSr59owjw-DqcOuTwB2Mbtyww8lU6Bf7On-90JhfoCHbWsMLwCSnqKFWOQjCxM-TZ6hoDJTM9Z5A--YTrf-IcUP3LTlRVp1DfOl5jDV-0At7UFusNpl_jsuOJtoL0GzwZZJKnzPbwZeoHUKf-F8Qy2D60FywmwY582UHbxWtAV08m-bdqDybna8YlI1iavrJ6QnkiPc1qNrFwD8WfrsZ2y2IYYB7r78bDc4jzjn--aZCg9KW-Is0qdbskW7aKc-YnzeAdgwu58_-HGxzYoNQyloejyFzSEjX6FnvMhTVSGJLA6pEx0z1StSp2U1VgRk29j7LoNFbt3YlaPupNUly-9Xp1V7_oPIA_St4_0DE/caiFsiIEE2L0A-GbSDG-p8Xt9ykj3sJT/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="为何今年东南亚雾霾危机如此严重"&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;搁置分歧&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;来解决这一问题。&lt;/em