blank" title="数据中心电源因美国顶级电网的紧缩而受到威胁"&gt;苦苦挣扎&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;但还有很长的路要走。需要更多的电源线、电池和长期能量存储。彭博新能源财经估计，到 2049 年，该国将需要向电网注入 3.9 万亿美元，远高于欧洲或美国预期的四分之一以上。 &lt;/p&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/S4p_kLSHdSwfkCNqsgPHucezapEYmimGFdvNgm1WvmZL9Uadb2ZF0R9j1KgkVLTnnc3Fl4bgOT1uB6WJFAEUEkn3gmVGHpYCLkeYkjAc3eQP2dstPMYga1biCB6nAp7pQzq9oVPpok-cktuewwvsQbsk51Pm41mwxX7EHkQNibAbnT2FoOS04ErTV8yfe_pAZgI3xG2iBmHTzFfVC55DHHEdzEPKytscUQL4dEyhqRkPynUDwR-HFKQwcx4K3PWI3KEEY3gsSQDbUpcWOe9PdjPNc0EgjUo8s8QELrl7FNpFghlEoXsus-7e2Atr7gLVJ7NFQDdFA9nnkYK5Gi7bBAL43kmt4thvFgDeyd4uQt-JTVQgk6ByRvambShPZwMuuumbq_v-kEeEKA_78l3B2ZxvQhrcFmfYF7VjfPvA_83OXxnNc4BJvsTazevIdrg482VpmbizWNKw4FvRHLB8COYFN40YmFg4S9TvPfVFudlUxenoRXzb/eCMbYAKb1SaSS1f8Y4vhxKvJ_DvT795u/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e; text-decoration: none !important;" target="_blank" title="中国人工智能与美国的竞争取决于利用其绿色能源优势"&gt;&lt;div style="display: block; width: 100%; height: 40px; margin: 24px 0 0 0; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; line-height: 40px; font-size: 14px !important; color: #000 !important; text-decoration: none !important;"&gt;继续阅读&lt;/div&gt;&lt;table align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top: 20px;" width="auto"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td align="center" style="padding: 0;" valign="top"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/1oEhX9uaHxXWZ8JfzXMfMnyIf01vgI7Y2Gk7coy_IR8Wj5kng7I55H8GQgps-DAvKSUQUQodGBWmNQuKSZ-HpsvdczfXTpODSA-CNwTbjJzm6yWjN6dknyWCl0PreZ146sZjIiDjzvcbSnefskC_6PLEU9NQdmVH4CVRERc5X00096uiRWUEU4ZE_WVe2xVFq2ezegCKf3hXN8g-nO9oQTvTHAF9ntzWWgCnxCAkRrcYz5gbA_GDAJ9CIRjVlzb0Oh3f22YZm0tuf9FXvk8v9ISbyv1ary9Az6d5-FyjmF8JyT80SQvBRBDC-A5S445CFWpux1X178YWMQKsZU5lv7Mfs6GnZCDzp1gDSfc59H8-Xeoa1X5QO-WozAASjXqIggbi38O2Aim2zwCQbXhAIgpoOjTcKUqpinHwv5M0adkPwNi8Vxl-DLFTxDrL1TxTOg5_TgU4jr0H2-L3/b0ZwJCq2AvxICg7l_FDmMsOzWLClEx7F/25" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank"&g